---
const src =
  "https://cdn.hob.farm/articles/hit-the-source-directly/engagement-factory-illustration-v2.webp";
---

<figure class="article-wide not-prose my-12 border-y border-base-800 py-6 sm:my-16 sm:py-8">
  <a
    href={src}
    target="_blank"
    rel="noreferrer"
    aria-label="Open the full-size engagement factory illustration"
    class="mx-auto block max-w-[58rem] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-base-800 bg-base-950 shadow-2xl shadow-black/20 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-accent-cyan"
  >
    <img
      src={src}
      alt="A detailed illustrated diagram contrasts an orange RSS pipeline from an independent publisher to desktop, phone, podcast, and local AI readers with a dark engagement factory producing outrage, reaction, repetition, retention, and endless scrolling."
      width="1491"
      height="1055"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
      class="h-auto w-full"
    />
  </a>
  <figcaption class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[58rem] text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-300">
    An independent publisher sends a new article through a direct RSS pipeline to
    several reader-controlled destinations while an engagement factory loops
    through outrage, reaction, repetition, and retention.
    <span class="mt-1 block text-xs text-base-500">
      Author-supplied ChatGPT illustration, August 12, 2026. Select the image to
      open the full-size file.
    </span>
  </figcaption>
  <details class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[58rem] border border-base-800 bg-base-950/60 p-4 text-sm text-base-300">
    <summary class="cursor-pointer font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-accent-cyan focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-accent-cyan">
      Read the illustration transcript
    </summary>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 pl-5 leading-relaxed">
      <li>
        The left side reads “RSS bypasses the engagement factory” and “A better
        route for good ideas.” An independent publisher works at a desk beside a
        newly published article.
      </li>
      <li>
        A bright orange RSS pipe carries the article past dark machinery labeled
        outrage, reaction, repetition, and retention. The machinery feeds a
        chaotic endless scroll filled with reaction symbols.
      </li>
      <li>
        The RSS pipe branches to a desktop feed reader, phone reader, podcast
        player, and local AI or search system.
      </li>
      <li>
        A comparison panel shows the engagement factory as a tangled route and
        the RSS pipeline as a direct line.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </details>
</figure>
